  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "衍生性金融商品",
    "sub_ename": "THE FINANCIAL DERIVATIVES",
    "describe_ch": "此為衍生性金融商品的進階研討課程，旨在熟悉期貨與選擇權之評價及期貨與選擇權之避險策咯等重要課題，學期中需作研究報告或作業，以期將財務理論與實務予以融會貫通。",
    "describe_eh": "This is an advanced seminar course in the field of financial derivatives.  It will provide students with the basic understanding of valuation of futures and options as well as the essential knowledge of hedging strategies using futures and options.  Research projects or homework assignments will be assigned to students during the semester.  The purpose is to familiarize students with the theories and concepts learned from the class and apply them to the real financial world.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
